WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.810
That'll be all for today.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.360
We'll finish up next week.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:12.680
Good work.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.710
Hey, you didn't do any work, Mashiro-san!

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:19.220
All you did was sharpen pencils.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:20.920
I-It may look easy,

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.220
but there's more to sharpening pencils than you'd think!

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:25.240
It's sharpened very well!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:28.580
Amu-chan's a third-class pencil sharpener!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.140
Third-class isn't exactly great.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:31.930
Not funny.

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:35.430
Okay, okay, okay!

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.590
What is it, Yuiki-san?

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.430
Why don't we finish the rest of this at my house tomorrow?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.320
Tomorrow is Sunday.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:45.240
Guardians never rest on the job!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.060
Yeah!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.800
Something's fishy.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.670
You were complaining as we worked today.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.270
Is there something special about tomorrow?

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.850
Nope.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:57.420
Wouldn't it inconvenience your family if we showed up on such short notice?

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.610
It's fine! It's fine!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.480
So it's settled!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.850
In that case, I'll organize the paperwork.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:05.350
Man, he's totally raring to go.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.230
All right, we'll meet at Yuiki-san's home tomorrow.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:15.220
Pretty Baby ☆ Huge Riot!

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:15.220
Episode 31

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.490
Is this outfit any good?

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:18.750
Maybe this one instead?

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.520
Or maybe this one.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:25.120
Wouldn't this necklace match that outfit?

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.020
Oh, that's good. You really know your stuff, Miki!

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:30.000
She was so against this yesterday.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.520
But now she's enjoying herself.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.230
That's because, even if it's a Guardians' meeting,

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.930
I'll be seeing Tadase-kun.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:38.390
Of course I'm excited!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.520
Sis, what's that? That!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.740
Huh?

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.310
Wow! That's cute!

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.370
Gimme!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.190
What?

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.330
That's kind of...

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.260
Sis is a meanie!

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:54.200
I wanna dwess up, too!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.680
Fine, you can borrow it!

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.720
No, please use it as long as you like!

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:01.540
Thanky, Sis!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.810
Mommy, look, look!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.770
It's tough being a big sister, huh?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.430
We've gotta hurry, or we'll be late.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.640
Oh no, I still haven't decided what to wear!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.330
What do I do?

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.650
We finally chose an outfit.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.060
Let's go to Yaya's house!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.020
Yeah, but...

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.630
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.870
Are you worried about something?

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.640
I think I need to tell them today.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.510
About the diamond egg.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:36.970
And how it's been marked by an X.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:38.970
So...

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.500
El!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:43.490
I'll introduce you once I've explained everything,

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.120
so keep yourself hidden until then.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.750
You noticed me following.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.080
I should have expected as much from Utau-chan's arch-nemesis.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.180
Understood!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.180
Covert behavior is easy as pie for a spy.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.390
You can count on me!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:57.980
Off to the front lines!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:01.200
Sneaky-sneaky-sneak!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.010
Is this going to work?

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:08.680
The first time Yaya-tan's home has been shown-dechu!

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.790
Hey, everybody!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:11.810
I've been waiting.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:14.220
Thanks for having us!

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.600
Come on in.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.170
This is the first time I've been to Yaya's house.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.900
It even smells like someone else's home.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:22.720
This is kind of exciting.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:25.130
We're not here to have fun, Joker.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.070
We're holding a special Guardians' meeting today.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.480
I know that, <i>Chairman.</i>

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.680
Chairman?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.840
My grandmother told me to bring these loquats as a gift.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.370
Where is your family?

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:41.450
Oh, he finally fell asleep, after crying for a while.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.600
Cried and fell asleep?

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:45.620
What's that?

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.070
Well, just come on in.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:54.930
Oh wow, it's a baby! So cute!

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:57.540
It looks newly born.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.600
What's its name?

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.620
Tsubasa.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.210
Is it male or female?

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.020
Male.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.340
Male?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.040
We're not talking about an animal here.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:09.510
He can't talk, and all he does is cry, so he might as well be one.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.670
It's impossible for me to babysit him by myself.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.520
Where are your parents?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.390
They left and won't be back until tonight.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.600
Which means...

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.060
Okay, okay, okay!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.180
Why don't we finish the rest of this at my house tomorrow?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.270
So you suddenly had the idea to hold a Guardians' meeting...

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.250
Bingo!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.640
To make everybody else help babysit Tsubasa!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.270
What do you mean, bingo?!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:35.890
I'm a kid, too!

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.560
I can't babysit by myself!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.230
Shh!

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.410
Quiet down, you two.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:42.600
You'll wake the baby.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.090
His cheeks are all puffy.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.650
His hands are so tiny.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.720
Yep.

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:02.250
So adorable.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.810
I was cuter than Tsubasa!

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:07.650
Look! Look!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.140
It's my baby album!

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:15.450
You were seriously cute!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.690
She looks like Tsubasa-chan.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.850
Tsubasa looks like me!

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.970
You haven't changed very much at all.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.560
Ah, you laughed at me!

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.310
That's creepy.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:30.470
Your third grade album's thinner than the rest.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.390
That's Tsubasa's fault.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:36.220
Mama's tummy got all big and everybody was busy.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.070
Babies sure have it easy.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:43.110
They're cute, so it doesn't matter if they can't eat or use the bathroom by themselves.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.070
They still get their papa and mama to themselves.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:46.600
That's the truth-dechu.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:47.600
Right?

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.310
So Yaya wants to be...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.720
I wish I was an only child.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.410
There isn't anything great about being an only child.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.970
Oh? You think so?

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.340
So Mashiro-san's an only child, huh?

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:09.930
Amu-chan, can I make something for Tsubasa-chan to eat?

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.720
But he's still a baby.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.670
It will be baby food he will be able to eat.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:19.430
I'll follow the recipe Yaya's mother has in the kitchen.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.300
Is that okay, Yaya?

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.890
If Su-chan's making it, it should be just fine.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:26.900
While you're at it, make me some snacks, too!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.350
Hey.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.640
Just leave it to me!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:37.160
You guys will make cookies for Amu-chan and everyone else.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.180
Okay!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:41.050
Why must I, the King, do this?

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:42.580
This can be considered training.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:46.100
I'm a baby, so I only know how to eat-dechu.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:50.310
First you cream the butter, and then you pour in flour!

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:51.540
Okay!

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.770
I'm falling! I'm falling!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.890
I fell!

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.270
Wasn't that on purpose?

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.410
What are you doing-dechu?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.660
Isn't it obvious?

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.160
It's my job as King to cut them into shapes, so I'm waiting for my turn.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.960
I wanna do it, too-dechu!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.490
That's not fair, just because you're the King-dechu!

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:12.360
What?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.230
You're awfully uppity for a commoner!

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:17.510
I'm a baby, not a commoner-dechu!

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:16.140
Let's do our best!

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.100
Are they going to be okay?

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:24.010
All right, let's take this opportunity to begin our meeting.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.960
Very quietly.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.670
Or else we'll wake the baby.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.350
This is weird.

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:34.850
Now, on today's agenda would be the recent increase in X Eggs.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:37.350
Yes, it certainly is abnormal.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:40.430
We found one during the tournament the other day.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.050
And one the day before that.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:43.850
That's right.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.950
Hey, why are you eating the loquat I just peeled?

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.450
My nails will get dirty.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.890
Then don't eat them!

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:51.180
But you know...

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:53.270
If Nikaidou-sensei quit working at Easter,

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:56.370
who's making all these X Eggs?

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:58.990
What's wrong, Amu?

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.140
You want Dia, don't you?

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:02.930
Then fight me!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:08.270
It's...

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.680
Wait!

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.140
Hold it, I say!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.470
Huh?

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:16.270
I was keeping quiet while you kept going on and on,

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:19.190
but my Utau-chan is honestly a good girl!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.850
She's not gathering X Eggs because she wants to!

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.810
Utau?

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.720
You mean Hoshina Utau?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.730
And, uh...

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.350
Whose Guardian Character is this?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.700
What's that?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.120
Dummy.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.680
Hoshina Utau's Guardian Character?

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.010
Her?

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:48.520
And she ran away from her owner's home?

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:50.100
Quite a fascinating precedent.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:51.760
Yeah.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:53.350
Well, a lot's happened.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.300
I have to tell everyone.

00:10:58.940 --> 00:10:59.770
My...

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:02.210
Huh?

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.720
He's in a bad mood.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.990
It's because you suddenly talked in a loud voice.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:10.890
Really?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.390
Perhaps he has some sort of beef with society?

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:19.310
Maybe he's uneasy because his mother's gone.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.580
Why don't you hold him, big sister?

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:22.330
What?

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.230
Just leave him alone and he'll be fine.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:25.310
Yaya!

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.770
Jeez! This is impossible!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.360
Rima-tan, please take him!

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:33.240
No.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.240
He can cry out of anxiety despite being so young.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.230
Fascinating indeed.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:41.580
Then you take him, Chairman!

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:42.060
What?

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.370
Th-This is too unexpected!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.360
Keep your calm, Kairi.

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:47.550
It'll be fine.

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.480
You just need to make sure you support his head.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.210
L-Like this?

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:52.560
Yep, you're good.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.540
King, please take him!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.350
Huh? Me?

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.480
Wh-What do I do?

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:07.200
Let me handle it.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.390
Nothing is impossible for me, the King!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.360
There need be no tears on the path of a king!

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.470
Laugh into the sky, young child!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.710
King, that's dangerous!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.180
He's pretty reckless.

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:24.000
Jeez.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.870
You're totally useless, Tadase.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.180
Wait, I know.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.720
Your cell phone's ringtone?

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:40.050
Tsubasa-dono's spirits have been lifted.

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.330
Amazing!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.430
But how...

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:47.390
They say it's good to divert a baby's attention without surprising them.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.180
I happened to have a good ringtone for that.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.750
Now that you mention it, I've heard something similar before.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:56.180
The sound of a music box is effective for treating illness or stopping an infant's crying at night.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:59.810
I'm impressed that you were able to put that to practical use, Joker.

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.220
It was nothing.

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:04.050
It was in her mom's magazine.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.680
<i>Housewife's Wisdom.</i>

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.750
Sorry for the wait, everyone.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:13.620
I've finished preparing Tsubasa-chan's food, and cookies for everyone else!

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:16.380
I ended up making everything by myself.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.050
I wonder what's wrong.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:25.370
His diaper, perhaps?

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:27.040
No, it's not that.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.250
He might want milk.

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.640
Ah, I forgot!

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:31.520
It's time for his milk!

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:33.250
We'll need to boil some water!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.900
There's an electric thermos.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.620
The water has to be boiled first.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.380
And you need to sterilize the bottle!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.100
Okay!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:40.390
Wow.

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.160
It's pretty hard to take care of a baby.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.430
The role of a mother is truly tasking.

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:47.890
I'm a baby, too.

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:51.340
Take care of me-dechu!

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:52.140
That looks fun!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.390
Go! Piggyback race!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.560
Ready, go!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.730
There is no burden a king cannot bear.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.430
Go! Go!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.430
This is nothing.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:02.650
What's going on here?

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:03.770
Musashi.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:06.720
Men are unfortunate creatures.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:11.330
It's boring as usual-nya.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.170
Isn't there anything fun-

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.770
Hey, I smell cookies!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.880
It's coming from that house-nya!

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.470
Those guys are...

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.270
Okay!

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:26.430
I'll toy with them for a bit-nya!

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.720
But first...

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.600
Okay.

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:31.740
Ta-da!

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:32.270
Yoru.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.690
I'm hungry-nya.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.720
So I'm taking these cookies-nya!

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.120
Shh.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.460
You'll wake up the baby.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.430
You can have the cookies, so get out of here!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:45.970
This is messing up my rhythm-nya.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.390
Ah!

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:48.930
My cookies!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.340
Give them back-dechu!

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.350
Hey, Yaya!

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.390
Character Change!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.770
Milky Beam!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:56.930
Strawberry Flavor!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.140
Now this is fun!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.390
Come on!

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:02.890
Give them back!

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:09.600
What?

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:12.370
Tsubasa-chan is crying.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:13.130
Hey.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.560
This is all your fault!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.400
It wasn't me!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.560
It's Yoru's fault!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.470
I-I've got nothin' to do with this-nya!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.280
You're not very manly-dechu.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.930
Fine-nya. I just have to stop his crying, right-nya?

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:46.960
The baby's the strongest.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.270
Amu-chan! Amu-chan!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:55.090
What do we do, Amu-chi?

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.850
In times like this, just leave it to Su.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.350
My heart:

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.720
Unlock!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.700
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:29.680
Return this room to its clean state.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:35.050
Remake Honey!

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.100
He's laughing!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.970
What a relief.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.730
I'm impressed, Hinamori-san.

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.020
You seem used to this.

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:00.440
Well done.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.030
My mom and dad both work,

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.170
so I often had to take care of my little sister.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.160
You'll make a wonderful mother.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:08.640
Y-You think so?

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.150
Meanwhile, the Ace is...

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.550
It doesn't matter!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.840
Mama always takes care of everything.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.090
It does matter!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.220
He's family!

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:19.360
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:20.520
Family.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.350
Here, Yaya.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.100
It's no fair, Tsubasa.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:31.270
You just have to cry or beg and everyone comes running.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.310
I want to go back to being a baby.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:38.890
I had no idea what to do when they suddenly told me to act like a big sister.

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.890
That's right, I also...

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:45.670
Jeez, Ami.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:47.310
You spilled it again.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.690
Thank you, big sister.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:54.320
I thought the words "big sister" were unfair.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.470
But...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.910
Sis!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:04.370
Ami's first word wasn't "mom" or "dad."

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:08.180
It kind of made me realize...

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:12.030
Babies, you know...

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.890
They're small and weak, and they can't do anything.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:18.250
But they make you feel happy.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.600
We all started out as babies.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:26.600
Our moms, dads, and other people, took good care of us as we were growing.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:30.970
That's why I think it's our turn to protect the baby.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:32.770
Right, big sister?

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.600
Thanks for everything today, guys.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.960
It ended up going as you planned.

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.010
Huh?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:55.310
Tsubasa feels warmer than before!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:56.450
Does he?

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:57.930
You're right.

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.720
What brought this on?

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.480
Maybe he's tired because of all the people around.

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.180
In any case, you should get in touch with your parents.

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.380
It's no use! They're not picking up!

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:11.190
I'm getting their answering service!

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.650
What about the family doctor?

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.560
I don't know the phone number!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.320
What should we do?

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.930
Will he get better if we let him rest?

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:20.890
We can't!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:25.060
Mama said that the slightest fever could be bad for a baby!

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.310
Won't your parents be home soon?

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:32.500
Maybe, but he might get worse while we're waiting.

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:38.780
Yaya, where are you taking him?

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:39.700
The clinic.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.180
But it's Sunday.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.290
I have to try.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.120
Ishikawa Clinic

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.540
Closed for the Day

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:55.810
This ship in a bottle that's taken me half a year is finally...

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.520
Doctor!

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.780
Who is it?

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.020
We're not open today!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:03.160
Doctor, Tsubasa is...

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:10.010
It's just a slight cold.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:12.470
The fever should break soon.

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:13.890
What a relief.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:18.560
So the Yuikis' pampered child has become a big sister.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.080
Sorry about your ship in a bottle, Doctor.

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:23.600
A baby's more important.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.320
You worked hard, big sister.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.750
Amu-chan, we should tell everyone about that.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:35.770
What?

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.970
Your egg turned into an X Egg?

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:39.150
Yeah.

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.130
I couldn't bring myself to tell you.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:42.520
Sorry.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.890
And Hoshina Utau has it?

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.560
That's dangerous.

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.390
How stupid.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.330
It's simple.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.220
You just have to take it back.

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.100
Since it's your egg.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:20:59.370
That's right!

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.130
Piece of cake!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.770
That plan's worth polishing up.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.620
You guys aren't disappointed?

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.970
Even though I'm the Joker, my egg turned into an X Egg.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.310
Not at all.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:13.380
Well, you can't do anything about what's already happened.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.910
Let's get Amu-chi's egg back!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:19.220
Helping a comrade is part of being a Guardian.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:20.380
See?

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.720
It'll be fine.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.130
Doctor?

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:29.220
It's Yuiki!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:30.350
Where are our children?

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.470
Papa! Mama!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:35.750
My goodness, what's wrong?

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:37.470
Your friends are watching.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:38.730
A koala?

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.520
Amu-chi, I've figured it out!

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:40.970
Huh?

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:43.290
I realized something after watching Tsubasa today!

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:48.040
My spoiled kid act is nothing compared to that of a real baby!

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:51.100
We'll work to master the art of being a baby-dechu!

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.440
Our goal is to become a baby!

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.350
Yeah!

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:57.470
She's back to her usual self.

00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:58.730
Mama!

00:21:58.730 --> 00:22:00.980
I wanna go home!

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:02.470
I guess Yaya will always be Yaya.

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:04.090
Honestly.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:05.970
Kairi.

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.140
Do not forget your duty.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:11.000
Don't get too close.

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:14.810
I know.

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:49.270
{random blurb}I'm number one today! Yay!

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:51.260
Hey, hey.

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:52.990
Don't you find it puzzling?

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:53.600
What?

00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:55.260
Mashiro-san's Character Change.

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:56.140
Now that you mention it...

00:23:56.480 --> 00:23:59.140
I wonder what she's like after a Character Change.

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:01.410
I bet she changes into a princess!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:03.540
A sweet, sweet lolita.

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:04.950
Or something unexpected, like a gothic punk.

00:24:04.950 --> 00:24:05.990
Too weak.

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:08.030
It's much more shocking.

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:08.470
Oh?

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:09.580
Really?

00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:11.310
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.310 --> 00:24:12.890
The Lonesome Queen!

00:24:12.890 --> 00:24:14.300
We will finally reveal...

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:15.570
The Queen's secret!

00:24:15.570 --> 00:24:18.400
If you don't watch, you'll regret it for a thousand years!
